		(descr "DFN-8 3x3 mm, 0.65 mm pitch, EP 1.55x2.4 mm (KiCad standard land, within AOS DFN3x3A_8L_EP1 PO-00047 recommended pattern). Fitted here: AONR21321 P-FET reverse-polarity block, standard CCW numbering 1-3=S, 4=G, 5-8=D, EP(9)=D. CAUTION: tab/EP is DRAIN (battery/connector side, VBAT_J8) - the OPPOSITE of the old CSD25404Q3 clip, whose big pad was SOURCE. A mirrored placement reverses the body diode and silently defeats reverse-polarity protection.")
